       <t indent="0" pn="section-4-1">The entity body of a POST or BREW request <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be of Content-Type
 &quot;message/coffeepot&quot;. Since most of the information for controlling
 the coffee pot is conveyed by the additional headers, the content of
 &quot;message/coffeepot&quot; contains only a coffee-message-body:</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-4-2">coffee-message-body = &quot;start&quot; | &quot;stop&quot;</t>
+      <sourcecode type="abnf" markers="false" pn="section-4-2"><![CDATA[
+coffee-message-body = "start" | "stop"
+]]></sourcecode>
